# Line endings: LF where the tools parse text (a Windows checkout otherwise adds CR and the question and export parsers fail).
# Archived run outputs keep the bytes the runner wrote.
# Images and office files are binary, also under the text paths above: a text rule there would strip bytes from them.
benchmark/questions/** text eol=lf
project/tools/** text eol=lf
knowledge/** text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
